{"title": "Beholder Ray", "pageid": 32670, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Beholder_Ray", "categories": ["Resources", "Class actions", "Class features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Beholder Rays</b> are a set of actions used by <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a> enemies. They use <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/2/2e/Red_Star_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Red_Star_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyestalk_Action\" title=\"Eyestalk Action\">Eyestalk actions</a> instead of normal actions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Beholder_Rays\">List of Beholder Rays</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confusion Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\">Confusion Ray</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Ray\" title=\"Fear Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fear Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Ray\" title=\"Fear Ray\">Fear Ray</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysing Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\">Paralysing Ray</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wounding_Ray_(Spectator)\" title=\"Wounding Ray (Spectator)\"><picture><source src